    "result_text": "The change is complete and the test passes.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented a **status filter** for the all-invoices list as a full-stack, additive change \u2014 narrowing the list to a single stage (e.g. only the ones you've sent):\n\n**Server** (`ListAllInvoices.java`): added an optional `status` query parameter. `ALL` (or blank) returns every invoice unchanged; any concrete status (`DRAFT`/`SENT`/`PAID`) filters with a parameterized `WHERE i.status = ?`. This is contained to the endpoint's own logic class \u2014 no shared wiring or YAML edits needed (the endpoint path is unchanged).\n\n**Front-end** (`features/invoices/feature.tsx`): added a `<select data-testid=\"invoice-status-filter\">` with an \"All stages\" default plus one option per stage. Selecting a stage updates local state and refetches `/api/all-invoices?status=\u2026`, so the list re-renders showing only the matching rows.\n\n**Database:** no migration was required \u2014 the `status` column already exists (`V5`/`V8`), and filtering on it needs no schema change.\n\nThe Playwright spec passes: all 3 rows show initially, and selecting `SENT` narrows to the 2 sent invoices (rows 1 and 3), with the draft (row 2) gone.",
